{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721602001:0":{"text":"指揮官、戻られたのですね。上層街の護衛任務は順調でしたか？","source_cn":"司令，您回来了。上城区的护卫任务还顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1396290F2DFCFDF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721602002:0":{"text":"ああ。殿下はもう王宮に戻られた。向こうの警備も強化しておいた。今日は休みを取っていたはずだが、まだ帰っていなかったのか。","source_cn":"王子殿下已安全返回王宫。我也加强了那边的巡防。我记得你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F79FB4460F8A9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721602003:0":{"text":"……お父様、どうか私も古聖堂消失事件の調査に参加させてください！","source_cn":"……父亲，我想跟你谈谈圣古堂和佩吉的失踪案，我请求参与调查！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9015A7CB848053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721602004:2":{"text":"王宮でもはっきり言ったはずだ、この件は私とマーリン殿が調べる。お前には関係ない。","source_cn":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF851005BEC5A963E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"王宮でもはっきり言ったはずだ、この件は私とマーリン殿が調べる。お前には関係ない。","female":"王宮でもはっきり言ったはずだ、この件は私とマーリン殿が調べる。お前には関係ない。","variant_male_record_index":"229400","variant_female_record_index":"229401","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721602005:0":{"text":"お前の任務は、駐屯地で日々の治安維持に当たることだ。私の命令が聞けないというのか？","source_cn":"你的任务是待在驻地，处理日常治安事件。怎么？我的命令现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAADD38D0630A72F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721602006:0":{"text":"そんなのおかしいです！私は守備軍第一部隊の小隊長です。王族が行方不明になった以上、捜査に当たる責務があるはずです！","source_cn":"这不合理！父亲，我是守备军第一分队的队长，王室成员失踪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EE9CE52B0B58A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721602007:0":{"text":"それに、ペギー様は王女であると同時に、私の友人でもあるんです！","source_cn":"更何况，佩吉不仅仅是公主，她还是我的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5866070370D018CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721602008:0":{"text":"隊長ならば、なおさら上官の命令に従うべきだ。","source_cn":"正因为你是队长，你才更要服从命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EA8FB53B413CDCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721602009:2":{"text":"大勢が見ている前で古聖堂が消えたのだぞ。背後にどんな勢力や手口が潜んでいるかも分からん……下手をすれば、政治的な駆け引きが絡んでいる可能性すらある。お前の手に負える事件ではない！","source_cn":"能够让整座圣古堂在所有人面前消失……这背后牵扯的势力、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47BBCBBB8CE4837B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721602010:0":{"text":"だから何だって言うんです！脅威に立ち向かうのが、守備軍の務めではないのですか？","source_cn":"那又如何？！守备军的职责不就是面对威胁吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39DFF399AA9B37A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721602011:0":{"text":"敵が強いから、危険だから、手口が分からないからといって、身を引けというのですか？","source_cn":"难道因为敌人可能强大、危险或者手段诡异，我们就能躲起来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA872A69A563F7124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721602012:0":{"text":"どうして……どうして私を信じてくれないのですか……？","source_cn":"为什么……您总是不肯相信我是有能力的……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB77F77D67BC63E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721602013:2":{"text":"策謀の前では、勇気も力も意味をなさないからだ！私が守備軍の指揮官であるかぎり、お前が調査に加わることは決して許さん！","source_cn":"因为你的勇敢或者能力在阴谋面前一文不值！只要我还是守备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8D22F68B720521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721602014:0":{"text":"家へ帰るんだ、グウィネス隊長！","source_cn":"你可以回家了，格温妮丝队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x097326378747643D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721602015:0":{"text":"……分かりました、指揮官殿。お望み通り、「聞き分けのいい」娘でいるよう努めます。","source_cn":"……遵命，司令阁下。如您所愿，我会努力做一个“听话”的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6251D9557178122A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216030.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721603001:0":{"text":"はぁ……もうここにはいたくない。","source_cn":"……呼，我得离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A079C087DE647F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721603002:0":{"text":"気晴らしに、広場にでも行こうかしら。","source_cn":"去广场那里散散心吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC2C513603D4B12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721604001:1":{"text":"あれは、ドゥドゥボックスの出店ね。","source_cn":"那里是，萌友宝盒的摊位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C08BDB8C43F8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721604002:1":{"text":"気分が晴れないときは、買い物で発散するのもいいかも。","source_cn":"去抽抽看吧，就当是花钱消气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA573EC1C3B94E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216050.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216050","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721605001:1":{"text":"さすがはグウィネスさん！守備軍の隊長は、強いだけじゃなくて運もいいんですね！","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，你太厉害了！这实力和运气，不愧是守备军的队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2F58B7DB6F451E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721605002:1":{"text":"嬉しい……今日は滅入ることが多かったのですが、ドゥドゥボックスのおかげで、少しは救われた気がします。","source_cn":"看来，我今天遇见的也不全是坏事。至少在宝盒这里，付出就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450A91BE3B6C31A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721605003:1":{"text":"それは良かった！あなたのように度胸も運もある方なら、何をなさってもきっとうまくいきますよ！","source_cn":"那是当然！像您这样既有魄力又有运气的人，无论做什么肯定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719664224A38DBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721605004:1":{"text":"さあ、「戦利品」をお受け取りください。またのお越しをお待ちしております！","source_cn":"记得拿好您的“战利品”，欢迎下次光临哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D9EBC24C3965F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银职员爱丽丝":{"text":"商会職員のアイリス","source":"秘银职员爱丽丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216060.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721606001:0":{"text":"気分も落ち着いたし、駐屯地に戻って仕事の続きをしましょう。","source_cn":"好受了很多，可以回驻地继续工作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C75ECCC266F17AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17216070.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721607001:1":{"text":"エリエルのお友だちになってあげてくださいね。","source_cn":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498BB7F47F6E6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721607002:0":{"text":"なあ、ホーレン。ここって守備軍の駐屯地だよな？","source_cn":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE7288202440BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721607003:0":{"text":"ははっ、まるで貴族のご令嬢の寝室みたいだな！","source_cn":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF982B19FE203FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721607004:1":{"text":"おいおい、その言い方はないだろ……みたい、じゃなくて、本物の貴族のお嬢様なんだからよ！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE395A567A69663DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721607005:1":{"text":"まあ、弓ばかりいじってるのもしんどいよな。たまには童心に返って癒やされたいんだろうよ。","source_cn":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88DFF7D3C4497C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721607006:1":{"text":"癒やしねえ。そんなふにゃふにゃしたもので喜ぶのは、三歳児くらいじゃねえの？","source_cn":"安慰玩偶嘛？这种软趴趴的东西，三岁小孩才玩吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B15E3565B1D76EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721607007:1":{"text":"休憩時間に、私が私物で何をしようと、あなたたちには関係ないでしょう。","source_cn":"现在是自由活动时间。我的私人物品与你们无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E219859AF761DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721607008:1":{"text":"そんなに暇なら、荷重トレーニングをもう二セット追加しますか？","source_cn":"如果太闲，我不介意让你们加两组负重跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F31B5BBAB00CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721607009:2":{"text":"そんなに怖い顔しないでくださいよ、グウィネス隊長。俺たちはただ、守備軍の駐屯地にそれは場違いだと思っただけで。","source_cn":"别这么严肃嘛，格温妮丝队长。我们只是觉得……这东西和守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F704B0741C0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721607010:1":{"text":"守備軍の兵士がぬいぐるみなんかで遊んでるところを王都の民衆にでも見られたら、軍全体のイメージダウンに繋がりますよ。","source_cn":"毕竟您是守备军，是战士。真正的军人，应该像我们一样强壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78C75C57D3C4C58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721607011:1":{"text":"隊長たる者、もっと守備軍らしく振る舞ってもらわないと困ります……ね？","source_cn":"你这样子，可没有一点守备军的模样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0230132F0070471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721607012:1":{"text":"なるほど、あなたたちのように偏見にまみれ、自分の無能を粗野な振る舞いで隠すのが、守備軍らしいというわけですか。