,"say:17:1721611015:1":{"text":"あなたの知らない事情があるのですよ。ペギー王女は王妃殿下の一人娘でしょう。今は国王陛下もご病気で、王妃殿下が摂政を務めている……","source_cn":"这就是你不知道的内幕了。毕竟佩吉公主是王后陛下唯一的孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87ABF4DE11FE0CB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721611016:1":{"text":"ですから、今回の事件は、王妃殿下が王女の評判を高めようとして、自ら仕組んだのではないかと言われているのですよ。","source_cn":"大家都猜，是王后想趁着庆典为佩吉公主造造势，好提升公主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6B2C7ED6F932C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1721611017:1":{"text":"けれど、結局剣は抜けず、本人もいまだ戻れないまま……まったく――","source_cn":"结果剑没拔出来，人还陷进去了。真是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB9FDBCCF94B71FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1721611018:1":{"text":"カロリーヌ、言葉を慎みなさい。そのような根拠のない非難は、王妃殿下への不敬になりますよ。","source_cn":"卡罗琳，慎言。这种毫无根据的指控是对王后陛下的不敬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC24725C40A493C05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1721611019:1":{"text":"あら、わたくしはあくまで他人の推測を述べただけですのに、そんなふうに怒らなくてもよろしいでしょう……","source_cn":"哎呀……我也只是转述别人的猜测嘛，干嘛这么凶。反正大家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA40D01B598BF9807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":